     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Peacekeeping - UNMISS</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:title>
   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Joint UN police and South Sudan Police Services cheers during rope pulling at International Day of Peace celebration at Nyakuran Culture Center. The Republic of South Sudan celebrates International Day of Peace for the first time under the theme: â€œLet your voice be hardâ€ after acquiring her independence in 9th July 2011.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
