   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">5 hectares of unused land has been converted into â€œAgricultural parkâ€ with UNDP support in Altai mountains. &#xA;&#xA;Altai Sayan UNDP project aims at conserving and sustaining globally significant biodiversity in Mongoliaâ€™s Altai Sayan eco-region.&#xA;&#xA;These photographs depict the families working in the sea buckthorn field and shows their living conditions in a ger (Mongolian traditional tent).&#xA;</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
