   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Secretary General travels to Haiti this yesterday along with Former US President Bill Clinton. Haitian Pop Star Wyclef Jean was also part of the delegation traveling to Haiti.&#xA;The SG and the pres. visited a" Multiwear" Factory at Sonapi  industrial park.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
