   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">12 June 2010 - Dhaka, Bangladesh - Kallayanpur slum,  one of the urban slums in Dhaka: 1.1 billion people in developing countries have inadequate access to water, and 2.6 billion lack  basic sanitation. 1.8 million children die each year as a result of diarrhea caused by poor water (2006 United Nations Human Development Report) Photo Credit:Kibae Park/Sipa Press</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
